{
  "meta": {
    "kind": "production",
    "id": "hurufi.production.literacy.wave6",
    "title": "Literacy path — Wave 6",
    "description": "Sixth production literacy slice: letter ت on the Wave 5 SHOW → PRACTICE → TEST pattern. Reuses fatha and Wave 4 sukun/CVCC. تَمْر is pause/citation CVCC. دَفْتَر is the first 4-letter decode (length only; no new phonics rule). تَمْر vs قَمَر is a useful visual/decoding contrast, not a strict phonological pair. No س, ن, خ, madd, diphthong, or Wave 7.",
    "notProductionCurriculum": false
  },
